  "problem_statement": "In the unicoap option set, `unicoap_options_remove_all()` must reduce the size reported by `unicoap_options_size()` by the total size of every entry removed for the requested option number. When the matching entries include multiple trailing entries, the size is currently not reduced enough. For example, after `unicoap_options_set()` adds option 4 with a one-byte value, `unicoap_options_set()` adds option 1 with a one-byte value, and `unicoap_options_add()` adds another option 4 with a one-byte value, `unicoap_options_size()` is 6; after `unicoap_options_remove_all()` for option 4, the size must become 2.",
